                  "speaker": "Elio",
                  "text": "Hold still. I'm fitting the cells into the housing..."
                },
                {
                  "speaker": "",
                  "text": "The four cells lock together. Light pulses through the seams, faster and faster — then the Mag lifts off Elio's hands and drifts toward you."
